---
// Warm Dark is the only theme this site ships, so the docs section is pinned to it
// unconditionally instead of reading `prefers-color-scheme` / `localStorage` like Starlight's
// default ThemeProvider does. Paired with the empty ThemeSelect.astro override (no picker to
// change it) and wired in astro.config.mjs via `starlight({ components: { ThemeProvider, ... } })`.
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark'
</script>
